# listen — a speaker alone in a room is not offered to be listened to
#
# The weaver is the only person in the Test Room (--npc-static), so there is nobody for them to be
# talking with, and listening to them would only read as starting a conversation. `goal listen`
# therefore finds nothing to pin, which is the assertion: the narrowing flag missing is expected here.
#
# FLAGS: --playground --skip-childhood --debug --seed 42 --no-encounters --auto-dialogue --location-type test --location-id 0 --npc-static --start-area "Test Room" --period noon --observe-only "weaver"

wait
click menu New
wait mode ProtagonistCreation 20
click continue
wait mode WorldView 60
travel here
wait mode LocationInteraction 60

strategy succeed
goal listen
advance 12 180

click keyword 0
choose 0
choose 0
advance 12 180
regions
expect-not listen to

allow-flag-miss --goal-only
quit
